&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:41.3pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18.8pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:41.3pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18.8pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐ明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;[炭素関連資産の状況]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:30.1pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐ明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;当社グループの総与信残高※１に占める炭素関連業種※２の与信残高及び貸出金における割合は以下のとおりです。&lt;/p&gt;
